OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity to research high-rise
OL,4,Afire safety
OL,5,
OL,6,FA university and construction firm will
OL,7,Fanalyse the "chimney effect" that
OL,8,Fcontributed to the rapid spread of
OL,9,Fsmoke and flames during the 2017
OL,10,FGrenfell Tower fire.
OL,12,FThe chimney effect is when hot gases,
OL,13,Ffire and smoke rise rapidly through
OL,14,Fvertical shafts in a building,
OL,15,Fspreading upwards, downwards and
OL,16,Fhorizontally.
OL,18,FThe University of Hertfordshire said
OL,19,Fits scientists would work with Welwyn
OL,20,FGarden City-based Ambar Kelly on "one
OL,21,Fof the construction industry's most
OL,22,Foverlooked safety problems".
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
