OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1793602623
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity to research high-rise
OL,4,Afire safety
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlex Bardett, the managing director of
OL,7,Fthe company, said the tragedy "led to
OL,8,Fthe removal of combustible cladding,
OL,9,Fbut riser shafts remain overlooked,
OL,10,Fdespite their role in vertical fire
OL,11,Fspread".
